  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a constantly changing external environment, Employers and Business Membership Organizations (EBMOs) are requested to continuously evolve and adapt. Sectoral and global trends, new business models, new ways of doing business and new ways of working are shaping a new business landscape. 
In the last biennium ACT/EMP set up a Network of Employers Organization from Asia and Arab States sharing common challenges and concerns on how to rethink their management and financial structure and expanding their mandate and services to reflect the emerging needs of the businesses they represent., how to remain relevant and reinforce traditional services Representatives from Oman, Bahrain, Saudi Arabia and Jordan together with top-notch organizations from India, Singapore, Korea, Japan have created this network. The network will continue to expand and develop new actions supporting exchanges among these 2 regions.</narrative>
  </description>
